  - key: 
    value: 
  - key: PAYTABLE_NAME_PAGE_1
    value: <style=title><size=23>CHOOSE YOUR EXTRA BET</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1
    value: "<size=17>-  Each bet consists of Base Bet and Extra Bet.\n-  When Extra
      Bet increases, credit values appearing on Bonus symbols also increase.\n-  Change
      the bet level at any time by tapping the \"Change Bonus Bet Level\" button.\n<size=3>\n
      \         <size=17>                 Credit        : Up To x 100\n                   Extra
      Bet   : 125% \n<size=1>\n <size=17>                   Credit        : Up To
      x 80\n                   Extra Bet   : 100% \n<size=1> \n    <size=17>                   Credit
      \       : Up To x 60\n                   Extra Bet   : 75%\n<size=1> \n <size=17>
      \                  Credit        : Up To x 40\n                   Extra Bet
      \  : 50% \n<size=1> \n <size=17>                   Credit        : Up To x 20\n
      \                  Extra Bet   : 25% \n- All Bet Levels are based on Base Bet.\n"
  - key: SIGN_BOARD_WIN_DESCRIPTION_11
    value: "5 = <style=coinColor>600</style> Pay, <style=coinColor>20 </style>Free
      Games\r</style>\n4 = <style=coinColor>120</style> Pay, <style=coinColor>15 </style>Free
      Games\r</style>\n3 = <style=coinColor>40</style> Pay, <style=coinColor>10 </style>Free
      Games\r</style>\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_11
    value: <style=title><size=21>BONUS SYMBOL</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_10
    value: <style=title><size=21>SCATTER</style>
  - key: SIGN_BOARD_WIN_DESCRIPTION_10
    value: "<size=18>-Bonus Symbols appear with credit values. \n-Credit values may
      be awarded if \nRapid Link Bonus is triggered with 5 or more Bonus symbols.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_NAME_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=23>Rapid Link Bonus</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=17>-  5 or more Bonus symbols in any position triggers the 'Rapid
      Link Bonus'.\n-  Number of initial Bonus symbols determines the number of free
      spins played.\n-  All initial Bonus symbols get locked, while remaining spots
      spin individually.\n-  Any new Bonus symbols will also get locked while remaining
      spots spin for remaining spins.\n-  When no more spins remain, Pick a Shield
      bonus may be triggered randomly to award extra free spins.\n- 'Rapid Link Bonus'
      ends when there are no more spins remaining.\n-  Award the total sum value of
      all credit values appeared on the Bonus symbols including any Jackpot amounts.\n-
      \ If all 20 spots are filled with Bonus symbols, award total pay x 2. \n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_NAME_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=21>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_NAME_PAGE_5
    value: <style=title><size=21>ADDED BONUS FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_NAME_PAGE_6
    value: <style=title><size=21>PICK A CHEST BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=21>-  3 or more Scatters triggers Free Games. \n-  Scatter symbols
      are removed in Free Games.\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5
    value: "<size=21>-  'Added Bonus Feature' may be triggered randomly during Free
      Games.\r\n-  When triggered, extra Bonus symbols will be added to the reel strips
      for one spin.\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_6
    value: "<size=21>-  In Base Game, each Bonus symbol may randomly trigger a 'Pick
      a Chest Bonus.'.\n-  Picking a chest may award one of the following bonuses:\n\r-
      \ Rapid Link Bonus\r\n-  10 Free Games\r\n-  Coin Prize  'Pick a Chest Bonus'
      trigger probability depends on the number of Bonus \n    symbols landed on reels.\r"
  - key: SPG_DECO_TEXT
    value: '{0} BONUS SHIELD AWARDS'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Spartan Gold
